  "description": "Subject: Eiffel Activity Finished \u2013 Build\u202f#1234 (ID\u202fa3f1c2d4-5b6e-3a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d)\n\nThe Jenkins job (URI\u202furn:jenkins:job:1234) on host\u202fci.example.com, belonging to the domain\u202fexample.com, has completed its activity. This EiffelActivityFinishedEvent (type\u202fEiffelActivityFinishedEvent, version\u202f2.0.0) was recorded at epoch\u202f1718425600000. The event is tagged with \u201cbuild\u201d and \u201cci\u201d. Security metadata indicates that the author was\u202fjohn.doe@example.com and the encrypted digest for this event is\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f6.  \n\nThe outcome of the activity is **SUCCESSFUL**, with the description \u201cBuild completed successfully.\u201d Persistent logs are available; the file\u202fbuild.log\u202fcan be accessed at\u202fhttp://ci.example.com/artifacts/build.log. Additional custom data reports a test coverage of\u202f85.3\u202fpercent (key\u202fcoverage, value\u202f85.3). This event is linked to its cause via the target ID\u202fb4e2f3a5-6c7d-4e9f-8a1b-2c3d4e5f6a7b (link type\u202fCAUSE).",
